  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "23",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë di̱l Puɔl ji̱ luɔ̱k guec, cuɛ wee i̱, “Dämaari, ɣän cä cieŋ nhiam Kuɔth kɛ ŋäc lɔaac mi gɔaa, amäni wa̱lɛ mɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bo̱o̱th palä in di̱i̱t ni A-na-ni-ath nɛy tëë te cuŋä gekädɛ jiök ɛn ɣöö bikɛ thokdɛ pat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Puɔl ɛ jiök i̱, “Bi Kuoth ji̱ pat, ji̱n päny mi ca rɔth kɛ buɔ̱yɛ! Ji̱n nyuuri ɛn wi̱ni kɛ ɣöö bi ɣä luk kɛ ciaaŋ ŋuɔ̱tni, kä a gua̱c kɛ ŋut lari jɛ i̱ ba ɣä pat?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu nɛy tin cuŋ gekädɛ wee i̱, “Ji̱n kuethi bo̱o̱th palä Kuɔth in di̱i̱t?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Puɔl wee i̱, “/Ka̱n jɛ ŋa̱c dämaari, ɛn ɣöö ɛ bo̱o̱th palä in di̱i̱t, kɛ ɣöö ca jɛ gɔ̱r i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɣöth 22:28.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ‘/Ci bi ruac a jiäk kɛ bo̱o̱th nɛɛniku.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci Puɔl ɛ mir ɛn ɣöö tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn kɛ ji̱ Thɛ̈d-du-thii, kä tin kɔ̱kiɛn kɛ ji̱ Pa-ri-thii, cuɛ rɔal rɛy luɔ̱k i̱, “Dämaari, ɛ ɣän Pa-ri-thii, ɛ ɣän gat Pa-ri-thii pa̱ny. Gɔanykɛ ɣä kɛ kui̱ ŋäthädä kɛ jiëc nɛɛni ti ci li̱w li̱th.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë cɛ mɛmɛ lat, cu gak tuɔɔk kam ji̱ Pa-ri-thii kɛnɛ Thɛ̈d-du-thii, kä cu duɔl rɔ da̱a̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Kɛ ɣöö ɛ ji̱ Thɛ̈d-du-thii i̱ thilɛ jiëc li̱th, kiɛ jääk nhial, kiɛ yiëë, kä duundɛ ɣöö ji̱ Pa-ri-thii ti̱ti̱ diaal ŋa̱c.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ tekɛ wuɔ̱w mi di̱i̱t, kä cu tha̱a̱ŋ gɔa̱a̱ri ji̱ Pa-ri-thii rɔ̱ jiɛc, cukɛ ruac a bum i̱, “Thilɛ duer mi cakɔ jëk kä jɛn wut ɛmɛ. Kä dɔ̱ŋ ci yiëë kiɛ jääk nhial ruac kɛ jɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci gak wee kɛ di̱t, kä cu kuäär lathkëëri dual kɛ ɣöö ba Puɔl näk ɛ kɛn, cuɛ lathkëëri la̱t lat kɛ ɣöö bikɛ wä, ba jɛ wä ka̱m raar kɛ buɔ̱m rɛydiɛn kä ba jɛ nööŋ guäth lathkëëri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ jɛn wäär ɛmɔ, cu Kuäär ni Yecu cuɔ̱ŋ gekädɛ wëë i̱, “A lɔcdu bum! Kä ce̱tkɛ min ci nën lat kɛ kui̱dä kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, ɛnɔ bi nën dhil lat kä Röm bä kɛ kui̱dä.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ca̱p go̱rä na̱k Puɔl",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ruacɛ kɛ runwaŋ, cu tha̱a̱ŋ ji̱ Juudh rɔ̱ mat kä cua ca̱p cäp. Kä cukɛ rɔ yac i̱ /cikɛ bi mi̱th kä /cikɛ bi maath, ɛ ni mi cikɛ Puɔl näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ tekɛ wutni ti la̱nykɛ jiɛn ŋuan tin ca ca̱p ɛmɛ la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ wä kä bööth palä tin di̱t kɛnɛ di̱t, kä cukɛ wee i̱, “Cakɔ rɔ̱ yac a bum ɛn ɣöö thilɛ mi̱eth mi bakɔ met, ɛ ni mi cakɔ Puɔl näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ täämɛ bi yɛn amäni ji̱ luɔ̱k kuäär lathkëëri in di̱i̱t jakä thok, kɛ ɣöö bɛ Puɔl nöŋ yɛ, ce̱tkɛ mi görɛ ɣöö bia ŋäc mi gɔaa jek kɛ kui̱ luɔ̱kdɛ. Kä cakɔ rɔ rialikä, bakɔ jɛ näk a ŋot a /kenɛ ni cop.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ cu gat nyiman Puɔl ca̱p bi̱mä nɔmɔ liŋ, kä cuɛ wä guäth lathkëëri, kä cuɛ jɛ wä la̱r Puɔl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Puɔl kuäär lathkëëri kɛl cɔl, kä cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “No̱ŋni ŋuɛ̈t ɛmɛ kuäär lathkëëri in di̱i̱t kɛ ɣöö tëëkɛ mi bɛ wä la̱t jɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛnɔ cuɛ jɛ naŋ kä kuäär lathkëëri in di̱i̱t, kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Puɔl in la mabuuth, cɛ ɣä cɔl kä cɛ ɣä thiec i̱ bä ŋuɛ̈t ɛmɛ nöŋ ji̱, kɛ ɣöö tëëkɛ mi bɛ ben la̱r ji̱.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu kuäär lathkëëri jɛ käp tetdä, kä cɛ jɛ naŋ gekä, kä cuɛ jɛ thiec a tek kä rɔ̱ i̱, “Ɛŋu ɛn ni̱n bi la̱r ɣä?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ŋuɛ̈t ɛ loc i̱, “Ji̱ Juudh cikɛ ruac mat ɛn ɣöö ba ji̱ thiec kɛ ɣöö bi Puɔl nööŋ guäth luɔ̱k iruun, ce̱tkɛ mi görkɛ ɣöö ba ruac ŋäcä mi gɔaa wä thiec kɛ kui̱dɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ji̱ /ca pɛl ɛ kɛn, kɛ ɣöö nɛɛkiɛn ti la̱nykɛ jiɛn da̱ŋ ŋuan a biemkɛ jɛ ni. Cikɛ rɔ̱ yac ɛn ɣöö /cikɛ bi mi̱th kiɛ ma̱th ɛ ni mi cikɛ Puɔl näk. Kä täämɛ ca rɔ̱ rialikä, kä liɛpkɛ ni ruac kä ji̱.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛnɔ cu kuäär ŋuɛ̈t jakä wä, gokɛ jɛ i̱, “A thil ram mi lätdi jɛ ɛn mɛ ci la̱r ɣä mɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jäkni Puɔl kä kuäär ni Pi-lik",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär lathkëëri in di̱i̱t kua̱r lathkëëri da̱ŋ rɛw ti tɔatni cɔl, kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Rialɛ rɔ̱ ikä kɛ gua̱a̱th thaak bäŋuan ɛn wääri bia wä kä Thɛ-tha-ria kɛ lathkëëri ti kur rɛw kɛ ji̱ jiöŋkööri ti jiɛn bärɔw kɛ ji̱ mutni ti kur rɛw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä muɔcɛ Puɔl jio̱o̱k tuɔ̱ruɔ̱k ti bɛ kɔt bä, kä nöŋɛ jɛ kuäär ni Pi-lik, a thil mi gueer jɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär lathkëëri in di̱i̱t warɛgak gɔ̱r kɛ ruac ɛmɛ:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ɣän Ki-lɔ-diäth Li-thiäth, nërä ji̱, ji̱n kuäär in gɔaa ni Pi-lik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wut ɛmɛ ca jɛ käp ɛ ji̱ Juudh, kä cua jɛ dee näk ɛ kɛn. Kä mëë cä jɛ liŋ ɛn ɣöö ɛ di̱el Röm, cua wä kɛ lathkëëri kä cua jɛ luäk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë cä go̱r ɛn ɣöö bä luɔt kä min gɔanykɛ ni jɛ ŋäc, cua jɛ naŋ guäth luɔ̱kdiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cua jɛ jek ɛn ɣöö gɔanykɛ jɛ kɛ kui̱ thiecni ŋuɔ̱tnikiɛn, kä cuɛ thil duer mi dee lia̱a̱ kiɛ yieen cop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ca ɣä la̱r thok ɛn ɣöö ɛ tëëkɛ ca̱p mi biemkɛ ɛn wut ɛmɛ, cua jɛ jäkä ji̱ ni kä kɛɛl, kä cä nɛy tin gɔanykɛ jɛ jiök bä ɛn ɣöö bikɛ min gɔanykɛ ni jɛ wä lat nhiamdu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛnɔ cu lathkëëri Puɔl naŋ, kä cukɛ jɛ nööŋ An-ti-pa-trith kɛ jɛn wäär ɛmɔ ce̱tkɛ mëë ca la̱t kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ruɔ̱n cu lathkëëri luny guäth lathkëëri, cu wä ni ji̱ jiöŋkööri kɛɛl kɛ Puɔl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cikɛ cop kä Thɛ-tha-ria cua warɛgak ka̱m kuäär, kä cukɛ Puɔl naŋ nhiamdɛ bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë cɛ warɛgak kuɛn, cuɛ wec in bä Puɔl thi̱n thiec. Kä mëë cɛ jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ɛ raan Thi-li-cia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cuɛ wee i̱, “Bä ruacdu ben liŋ mi wä nɛy tin gɔanykɛ ji̱ wä cop.” Kä cuɛ jɛ lar ɛn ɣöö ba jɛ yien guäth in la kuäär a te thi̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
